    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d14">

                <pb facs="0117" n="15" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg15"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Hopkins Papers: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President’s Special Assistant</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hopkins</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to Prime Minister Churchill
                    </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d14-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-04-09">April 9, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. Harry Hopkins to Prime Minister personal and most secret.</p>
                <p>Anthony must have misunderstood me relative to my coming to England immediately.
                    The President feels that the time not propitious until situation in Tunisia
                    clarified. He will be in direct touch with you soon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d14-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d14-f1-content">
                <p>Channel of transmission not indicated, but presumably military.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
